From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 01:12:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 2311 again: a typed introduction is made as an introduction
 (server part OFF)

0190 was reverted (box 55934, 0 of 6): for "ask Giorgi to connect me with
Nino" the model called neither request_introduction nor ask_contact, and
0190's fallback then said "not sent" instead of the plain question it sent
before. Both were wrong; 2311 asks for the introduction itself.

- The wider wording from 0190 is back ("damakavshiros", "shemaertos",
  "X-tan dakavshireba"), so ask_contact is refused for them and the model
  is told to make the introduction.
- When the run still leaves it undone, the server makes the introduction
  through requestIntroduction (the named go-between, the target in the
  nominative, the goal and thread), D316: the typed line is the consent.
- SERVER_INTRODUCTION_ON is false until Misho says yes to the owner's
  sentence; while off, the fallback is exactly main's.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
